    License 2.0.
  * The Unicode confusables mapping in src/oridjidji/preprocessing/data/ is
    derived from Unicode Technical Standard #39 and carries the Unicode
    licence.

Model weights are NOT covered by this licence and are NOT distributed in this
repository:

  * The fine-tuned encoder is published separately as a release artefact and is
    derived from BERTic (classla/bcms-bertic), Apache-2.0.
  * Gemma-2-2B, used by the optional Advanced mode, is governed by Google's
    Gemma Terms of Use. The installer downloads it from Google's own repository
    with your Hugging Face token and quantises it on your machine, so this
    project never redistributes it. By installing Advanced mode you accept
    those terms directly with Google.
